OL,3,GNEWSACouncil looks to tackle
OL,4,A'fly-parking' near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is exploring whether it can
OL,7,Fhelp solve the long-term issue of
OL,8,Fso-called fly-parking near the city's
OL,9,Fairport by repurposing a park and ride
OL,10,Fsite.
OL,12,FThe Norwich Airport Park and Ride is a
OL,13,F620-space facility located less than
OL,14,F400m (1,312ft) from the terminal,
OL,15,Fhowever, it cannot actually be used for
OL,16,Fairport passengers.
OL,18,FFly-parking, where cars are left on
OL,19,Fnearby roads instead to avoid charges,
OL,20,Fhas become an increasing problem in
OL,21,FHellesdon.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
